window.products.push({"id":1019289,"name":"Pure Art Joys of Spring - Cherry Blossom Flower Tree - Large Metal Wall Art Painting - Contemporary Decor Perfect for Home - Set of 5 Panels 64\" x 24\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p18JZLKQL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"At Pure Art, we believe that home decorating is a self-standing art that must be explored to its fullest potential. That is why we rely on top-quality material, reliable suppliers and complex manufacturing techniques, that help us create outstanding wall decor pieces which will make your home look modern and sophisticated. Add a Unique Touch to your Home with This Exquisite Metal Wall Art! Our metal wall art is definitely a must-have for every home. The fine lines and interesting combination of colors and nuances make this painting appear fabulous yet simple. The wall art is completed by silver lights that emphasize the colorful strokes when the light falls on them, making this painting seem realistic and alive. Also, it is quite versatile, as the panels allow you to add your personal touch and create your own wall decor structures. Handmade 3D Design that Draws attention This 3D wall art centerpiece will transform any wall in your living space into a hard-to-resist sight. Every artwork is hand painted, giving you a one-of-a-kind product that will standout on your wall. Because it is handcrafted, colors may vary slightly . Hang It In Seconds Pre-installed brackets in the back ensure fast, easy installation. Simply use the template included to decide where you will hang your artwork, place the nails and hang your wall art. Easy peasy! Some of the amazing features of this product: Quick, easy installation. Quick, easy installation. Elegant and modern Elegant and modern Makes a beautiful wall centerpiece Makes a beautiful wall centerpiece Realistic 3D design Realistic 3D design It can change its appearance with light It can change its appearance with light Brings more texture, light, and depth to any decor Brings more texture, light, and depth to any decor Non-corrosive aluminum Non-corrosive aluminum Original craftsmanship Original craftsmanship Superior quality Superior quality Suitable for bedroom, living room, or office Suitable for bedroom, living room, or office A beautiful present for your loved ones. A beautiful present for your loved ones. Your home will look spectacular with our abstract wall art!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p18JZLKQL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Art","source_asin":"B00P2O1E40","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1019289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P2O1E40","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P2O1E40","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
