window.products.push({"id":1019336,"name":"ALORAIR Air Scrubber with 3 Stage Filtration, Stackable Negative Air Machine for Industrial and Commercial Use, Heavy Duty Air Cleaner with MERV-10 Fi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":497.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oFAVKvaQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multilevel Filtration: This ALORAIR air scrubber has a 3-stage filtration system. It is equipped with a MERV-10 filter that can capture large particles and a carbon filter that can eliminate smoke and pet odor, a HEPA filter that can trap 99.5% of particles of larger than 0.3 microns. The unit size is very suitable for home repairs and construction sites, sewage repairs, water and fire repairs, salons and printing shops, etc. Heavy Duty and Easy to Operate: Rotomolded polyethylene (LLDPE) shell has great durability. It is easy to turn ON/OFF the air purifier through the control panel、adjust the airflow range of 270-550 CFM and the reset circuit breaker. It has an indicator light, the indicator light will light up to remind you when you need to replace the filter. You will find the auxiliary GFCI outlets on the panel. This air machine has a filtration area of 5,500 cubic feet and a maximum airflow of 550CFM. Easy to stack: This HEPA air scrubber can be stacked horizontally and vertically. You can daisy-chain up 3 to the maximum, with a combined airflow speed of 1650 CFM. The size is 20.87 x 24.8 x 14.96 inches, and the weight is 39.6 pounds which is easy to stack! Portable Air Scrubber: The air machine has a handle so that it’s easy to transport the air scrubber from one room to another room. Plug and play, don’t forget to eliminate the black cover before using this machine. Duct compatibility (optional) 16 inches for the air inlet and 8 inches for the air outlet, not included. 10-year warranty: ALORAIR air scrubber is fully compliant with electrical safety ETL. Every AlorAir air scrubber comes with a 10-year warranty and a professional customer support team that is ready to help. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. You deserve the best after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oFAVKvaQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALORAIR","source_asin":"B07RS3FNKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1019336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RS3FNKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RS3FNKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
