window.products.push({"id":1019774,"name":"Rapid Defrosting Tray, JUTTIRA Thickened Aluminum Meat Thawing Plate with Leakproof Elevated Edges to Catch Liquid, Fast Defrosting Plate Board Safe N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qi2D8sDqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you’ve forgotten to thaw your food, or you want to speed up the process, Thawing tray allows you to thaw your frozen food in the most efficient, natural, and healthy way. Ideal for thawing chicken breast, steak, beef, mince, pork, lamb chops, fish, seafood, hamburger patties, vegetables, etc.Rapid Defrosting The thickness of the fast defrosting tray is 6mm, which is 2 times thicker than other normal trays, it will defrost 3 to 5 times faster than at room temperature and can effectively improve the efficiency of your food preparation. Natural Thawing Our thaw plate for meat is made of high-density aluminum, which has excellent thermal conductivity and can realize high-speed heat exchange for a faster defrost while keeping the nutrients and flavor of food. No More Mess on Your Counter Featuring elevated edges to catch the excess moisture/liquid during the thaw and keep melt water on the tray.Deep Grooves Design Ensure room-temperature air to flow under defroster tray to transfer natural heat to the food and achieve a rapid thawing effect. Non-stick Coating and Easy to Clean This non-stick coated meat melting tray makes it easier to remove food from the surface and easy to clean.Specification: Color: Black Material: AluminiumWarm Tips: 1. The defrosting time will vary depending on the thickness of food, the contacting surface, and the room temperature. 2. It is advised to flip your food while defrosting to speed up the process.3. Remove food from packaging before placing it on the defroster mat and make sure your food is as flat as possible for the best defrosting effect. 4. Do not use the defrosting plate for meat as a chopping board or use wire brushes or steel wool to clean the surface to avoid damaging the non-stick surface and reducing the defrosting effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qi2D8sDqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUTTIRA","source_asin":"B08J3T8Z36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1019774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J3T8Z36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J3T8Z36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
