window.products.push({"id":1019884,"name":"TPDL for Dyson V7 Battery Adapter, for Milwaukee 18V M18 Battery Convert to Dyson 21,6V V7 Vacuum Converter Absolute, Motorhead Pro, Trigger, Fluffy H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P5jGqbm7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔋 【Perfect Compatible with Dyson All V6 Vacuum】TPDL adapter replacement for Milwaukee 18V M18 battery to 100% work as 21.6V Dyson V6 series, supports for Dyson V7 Absolute / Fluffy / Animal / Animal Pro + / Car + Boat / Allergy / Motorhead / Motorhead Pro / Mattress / Wireless / Trigger / Trigger with HEPA / Extra / HEPA, etc. SV11 / 968670/229687 (Note: Not fits V6 V8 series vacuum) 🔋 【Fit for Milwaukee M18 18V Battery 】Convert for Milwaukee 18V battery to replace for Dyson V7 . You can use V7 vacuum cleaner as normal when the original battery damaged, instead of buying a new one. Compatible with Milwaukee 18 volt M18 Battery 48-11-1811, 48-11- 1815, 48-11-1820, 48-11-1822, 48-11-1828 , 48-11-1840, 48-11-1841, 48-11-1850, 48-11-1852, 48-59-1850. (Note: Not fit for Milwaukee 48-11-2230 Battery) 🔋 【LED Indivator】 The V7 battery adapter designed with LED indicator on the left and right of the battery converter to show battery status. The light shows green which means normal work; and it shows red which means lack of power. High quality ABS material for long time use, Buy with Confidence. 🔋 【Easy to Use】 The for dyson V7 adapter converter is very easy to use, which makes your cleaning work more convenient and simple, you just insert to Milwaukee battery into the base of adapter and plug them together to for Dyson V7 cordless vacuum. When your cleaning work is finished, please remember to remove them. 🔋 【Safety Made & Customer service】The battery adapter for dyson complies with FCC RoHS and CE security testing standards; Built with over-charging, over-discharge, over-temperature, over-current, over-voltage, and short circuit protection, protect your for Dyson vacuum cleaner and for Milwaukee M18 battery adapter well. TPDL team offer 24 Hours 100% Satisfied Customer Supports for You.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P5jGqbm7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TPDL","source_asin":"B0B291Z7NF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1019884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B291Z7NF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B291Z7NF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
