window.products.push({"id":1019902,"name":"Digital Scale for Kitchen, Food, Postal or Jewelry Lightweight w/All-Glass Weighing Surface – Ounce, Milliliter & Gram Weight Units – Features 11 Poun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612pYITStJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooking is a matter of scale and proportion. If the kitchen is your temple and food is your preferred form of art, you surely appreciate the importance of rationing as a critical element of cooking, baking and storing food. So choose our Ivation kitchen scale, which makes it easy to weigh everything from a couple grams of herbs to a few pounds off a chunk of meat. A simple button on the front of the unit lets you select precise readings of ounces, milliliters and grams. Keep it handy around the kitchen, and you’ll find it to prove handy in endless situations. Best of all, the all-glass weighing surface is non-porous and cleans easy to promote kitchen hygiene. Smart Tare Function for Accurate Net Weight When using a container etc. to weigh another object, you want to know the exact weight of the object without the container’s added weight. The Ivation digital kitchen scale has a great tare function to accomplish just that. Start by placing the empty container on the weighing surface. The display will show you that empty weight. Press the power button, and the weight reading will go down to “0”, effectively adjusting the measuring guide. Proceed to place the object into the container or plate, and thus get an accurate net weight reading. Technical Specifications: Weight Capacity: 5kg/11lbs. Weight Capacity: 5kg/11lbs. Weighing Units: ml, fl. oz., g, lb: oz Weighing Units: ml, fl. oz., g, lb: oz Graduation: 1g Graduation: 1g Dimensions: 6.55” x 9.5” x 0.5” Dimensions: 6.55” x 9.5” x 0.5” Power Source: 2 x Button Battery Power Source: 2 x Button Battery Alerts: Low Battery, Weight Overload Alerts: Low Battery, Weight Overload Operating Temperature: 50°F to 104°F Operating Temperature: 50°F to 104°F Operation Humidity: Up to 90% RH Operation Humidity: Up to 90% RH Storage Temperature: 14°F to 122°F Storage Temperature: 14°F to 122°F","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612pYITStJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivation","source_asin":"B00N54J504","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1019902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N54J504","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N54J504","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
